    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's platform, Atelier also supports SSO through SAML and OIDC, and user directories via LDAP and Entra ID, which should enable accessibility from the hospital staff work environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, Our company's platform, Atelier median latency is 1.3 seconds, with common queries having a p95 latency below 2 seconds, which meets the client's requirement for response times compatible with daily clinical use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our hosting options include a Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and HDS-certified, ensuring high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, I propose an architecture that leverages Our company's platform, Ateliertegrated with the hospital's SIH and DPI systems through our standard connectors or custom adapters. our will utilize our HL7-FHIR connector to support health interoperability standards and ensure compatibility with the national health identifier (INS)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's platform, Atelier will be hosted on a Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud to guarantee high availability, with a target of at least 99.9% uptime." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve a target of at least 99.9% uptime, our will implement active-active redundancy across two availability zones and utilize our built-in monitoring, logging, and observability tools to ensure seamless operation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our existing technical stack and capabilities, I believe our can meet the client's requirements and provide a robust solution that integrates with the client's existing systems while ensuring high performance, availability, and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict GDPR compliance (EU-only hosting, no data transfer outside EU, encryption of sensitive data), and all AI recommendations must be explainable post-hoc." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with French HBERGEUR DE DONNEES DE SANTE (HDS) certification, SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent, and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and compliance measures do we need to implement?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security and Compliance officer at we, I can confirm that we is already ISO 27001 certified since 2023, with a scope covering Development, delivery, and operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "ISO 27001 certified ensures that we have a robust information security management system in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client demands for strict GDPR compliance, we will ensure that all data hosting is done within EU, and no data is transferred outside EU. we current hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud-qualified, which meets The client requirement for secure infrastructure. we also have HDS certification through we hosting infrastructure operated on Our current hosting partner, OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption of sensitive data, we already implement TLS 1.3 for encryption in transit and AES-256 for encryption at rest." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we use EU-based infrastructure for key management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide explainable AI recommendations post-hoc, we product Atelier is designed to provide source grounding and audit trails. designed supports a posteriori review and ensures that all outputs can be understood through all outputs underlying elements. we also have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, which is available upon request. we data protection agreements are aligned with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further comply with The client requirements, we will ensure that we solution integrates with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records, while supporting health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of environmental considerations, we will rely on low-carbon infrastructure to reduce energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our current hosting partner, OuraneCloud is expected to support rely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee the security and integrity of our solution, we implement secure software development life cycle (SDLC) practices, including code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider. we also have a defined vulnerability management process with remediation SLAs based on severity and a incident response plan in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these security controls and compliance measures, we can ensure that our solution meets The client strict requirements for GDPR compliance, explainability of AI recommendations, HDS certification, SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure, and low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget is estimated at 900,000 euros over 5 years, with annual operating costs that must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects cost optimization without sacrificing quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are we financially eligible to bid, and what is the projected margin on this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we financial context, we annual revenue is 6,200,000 euros, which indicates a strong financial foundation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have recently raised 12,000,000 euros in Series A funding, providing we with a comfortable cash runway." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client budget of 900,000 euros over 5 years translates to an average annual budget of 180,000 euros. we financial capacity note states that we figures place we above the typical financial-capacity thresholds for a 900,000-euro, 5-year public contract, and we turnover-based eligibility ratios are met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, we are financially eligible to bid on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To estimate the projected margin on this contract, we need to consider we target gross margin percentage, which ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming an average annual budget of 180,000 euros, we revenue from this contract would be around 150,000 euros per year (lower end) to 120,000 euros per year (upper end), considering the total budget over 5 years is fixed at 900,000 euros and we aim for a margin within our target gross margin percentage, which ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Using these numbers, the projected margin on this contract could be between 25% and 35% of the revenue generated from this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact costs associated with delivering this contract, it's challenging to provide an exact margin percentage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, we can aim to achieve a margin within our target gross margin percentage, which ranges from 25% to 35% by carefully managing we costs and pricing strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires AI components for intelligent assistance, drafting of clinical and administrative content, and support for medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current LLM stack and RAG capabilities meet these requirements, and how can our fine-tune our models to achieve high-quality outputs? our AI and innovation capabilities are centered around retrieval-augmented generation, or RAG, which combines the strengths of both retrieval and generation approaches. our core approach enables every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, with answers citing passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus for grounding." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements for intelligent assistance, drafting of clinical and administrative content, and support for medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10), our RAG capabilities can indeed meet the requirements for intelligent assistance, drafting of clinical and administrative content, and support for medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our have capabilities in hybrid retrieval (lexical + semantic), re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction (including assisting PMSI/ICD-10 coding from a clinical note), template-guided drafting (for discharge summaries, medical correspondence, administrative documents, and dossier syntheses), applicable rules recall during dossier handling, action and verification suggestions, and dossier-context continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To fine-tune our models for high-quality outputs, our can follow an iterative approach that involves corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop." ;
