    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Project Coordinator for Faber IA, the Project Coordinator for Faber IA can ensure that we project management methodology is well-suited to handle such a deployment process. we use a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, which allows we to break down The project into manageable phases and ensure smooth progress." ;
