    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To conduct The project progressively, we will start with the Framing phase, where we will work closely with the client to define the project scope, objectives, and timelines. the Framing phase, where we will work closely with the client to define the project scope, objectives, and timelines will be followed by the Design phase, where we will design the solution and create a detailed plan for a pilot phase on a limited perimeter of one or two departments." ;
