        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As we progress to progressive generalization to all services, we will work with the client to roll out the solution to all services, providing ongoing training and support as needed. we change management approach includes providing dedicated resources for change-management and training, which will help to minimize disruptions and ensure a smooth transition for the staff." ;
