    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of change management support, we will provide regular updates and communication to the staff, as well as training sessions to ensure the staff are comfortable using our Atelier platform. we will also establish a single point of contact for the client, who will be responsible for addressing any questions or concerns that may arise during the deployment process." ;
