    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for we, I can confirm that we is committed to maintaining up-to-date social and fiscal obligations and has administrative attestations available. we have experience with French public procurement and are familiar with the French Code Commande Publique." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we should flag the following legal risks:  1. **GDPR compliance**: As we will be handling personal and health data, we must ensure that we solution complies with GDPR regulations, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements. 2. **HDS certification**: we infrastructure hosting our solution must hold French HDS (Hébergeur de Données de Santé) certification to ensure compliance with health data hosting regulations. 3. **Medical confidentiality**: we must preserve medical confidentiality in accordance with French law." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate these risks, we should include specific contractual clauses or standard contractual terms in our bid, such as: 1. **Data protection clause**: Include a clause that outlines we commitment to GDPR compliance and we obligations regarding data processing and protection. 2. **HDS certification requirement**: Specify that we infrastructure hosting our solution will hold HDS certification. 3. **Medical confidentiality clause**: Include a clause that ensures the preservation of medical confidentiality in accordance with French law. 4. **Compliance with French law**: Include a general clause stating that we will comply with all relevant French laws and regulations, including those related to health data and medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we bid should highlight we experience with regulatory compliance in the healthcare sector, including we monitoring of obligations such as GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing these legal risks and including the necessary contractual clauses, we can demonstrate we commitment to compliance with regulatory requirements and increase the chances of a successful bid." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

